tin ribbon, beautifully placed against a pristine white finish. The handcrafted red heart centerpiece and delicate gold detailing add a touch of luxury, while the personalized anniversary message board completes its heartfelt presentation. A design that perfectly captures romance, elegance, and lasting devotion.',NULL,699,NULL,'[\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dvw9o0f8z/image/upload/v1780842088/blissbakery/products/1780842088326-5ftx1i.jpg\"]',0,0,0,1,NULL,'[\"anniversary\"]','[\"1-tier-\"]',NULL,'cmq2aide00001pvoou1f9tqu7','2026-06-07 14:22:52.151','2026-06-07 21:48:05.248','[\"Chocochips\",\"Hazelnut\",\"Nutella\",\"Belgian Chocolate\",\"Almond Truffle\",\"Truffle Dutch\",\"Butterscotch\",\"Salted Caramel\",\"Red Velvet\",\"Pineapple\",\"Blueberry\",\"Strawberry\",\"Kesar Pista\",\"Rose\"]','[]',300,249,'[{\"name\":\"Chocochips\",\"price500g\":550},{\"name\":\"Hazelnut\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Nutella\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Belgian Chocolate\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Almond Truffle\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Truffle Dutch\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Butterscotch\",\"price500g\":550},{\"name\":\"Salted Caramel\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Red Velvet\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Pineapple\",\"price500g\":450},{\"name\":\"Blueberry\",\"price500g\":450},{\"name\":\"Strawberry\",\"price500g\":450},{\"name\":\"Kesar Pista\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Rose\",\"price500g\":550}]','CUSTOM','Blueberry'),('cmq3vkkwf003epv1pkzq1ieii','Blush Rose Luxe Cake','blush-rose-luxe-cake-mq3vkkwf','This stunning cake showcases a graceful blend of blush pink and ivory tones, finished with elegant wave-textured frosting that wraps around every tier. Rich crimson blooms, lustrous pearl accents, and golden decorative spheres create a luxurious contrast, while delicate gold leaf details add a refined sparkle. A sophisticated floral masterpiece designed to leave a lasting impression.',NULL,749,NULL,'[\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dvw9o0f8z/image/up