",\"Truffle Dutch\",\"Butterscotch\",\"Salted Caramel\",\"Red Velvet\",\"Pineapple\",\"Blueberry\",\"Strawberry\",\"Kesar Pista\",\"Rose\"]','[]',300,199,'[{\"name\":\"Chocochips\",\"price500g\":550},{\"name\":\"Hazelnut\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Nutella\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Belgian Chocolate\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Almond Truffle\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Truffle Dutch\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Butterscotch\",\"price500g\":550},{\"name\":\"Salted Caramel\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Red Velvet\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Pineapple\",\"price500g\":450},{\"name\":\"Blueberry\",\"price500g\":450},{\"name\":\"Strawberry\",\"price500g\":450},{\"name\":\"Kesar Pista\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Rose\",\"price500g\":550}]','CUSTOM','Blueberry'),('cmq3vs7h60042pv1poh3rdpex','Ruby Heart Anniversary Cake','ruby-heart-anniversary-cake-mq3vs7h5','Elegantly finished in pristine white frosting, this cake features a sweeping ruby-red heart design piped across the top, symbolizing enduring love and togetherness. The matching red borders and anniversary message at the center create a timeless celebration look, while the clean minimalist finish keeps the focus on the heartfelt design. A classic choice for honoring beautiful years of marriage.',NULL,649,NULL,'[\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dvw9o0f8z/image/upload/v1780842575/blissbakery/products/1780842575151-eqlxxr.jpg\"]',0,0,0,1,NULL,'[\"anniversary\"]','[\"1-tier-\"]',NULL,'cmq2aide00001pvoou1f9tqu7','2026-06-07 14:32:13.530','2026-06-07 21:53:40.288','[\"Chocochips\",\"Hazelnut\",\"Nutella\",\"Belgian Chocolate\",\"Almond Truffle\",\"Truffle Dutch\",\"Butterscotch\",\"Salted Caramel\",\"Red Velvet\",\"Pineapple\",\"Blueberry\",\"Strawberry\",\"Kesar Pista\",\"Rose\"]','[]',300,199,'[{\"name\":\"Chocochips\",\"price500g\":550},{\"name\":\"Hazelnut\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Nutella\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Belgian Chocolate\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Almond Truffle\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Truffle Dutch\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Butterscotch\",\"price500g\":550},{\"name\":\"Salted Caramel\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Red Velvet\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Pineapple\",\"price500g\":450},{\"name\":\"Blueberry\",\"price500g\":450},{\"name\":\"Strawberry\",\"price500g\":450},{\"name\":\"Kesar Pista\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Rose\",\"price500g\":550}]','CUSTOM','Blueberry'),('cmq3vusjq004epv1pnwkmdrrj','Pink Pearl Romance Cake','pink-pearl-romance-cake-mq3vusjo','A charming celebration cake featuring a graceful blend of ivory and rose-pink wave textures that flow beautifully around the design. Decorated with vibrant pink blooms, shimmering pearl accents, and luxurious golden spheres, it is finished with a delicate double-heart topper that symbolizes love and togetherness. Every detail comes together to create an elegant and romantic centerpiece.',NULL,749,NULL,'[\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dvw9o0f8z/image/upload/v1780842759/blissbakery/products/1780842758962-rtsvgk.jpg\"]',0,0,0,1,NULL,'[\"birthday\",\"anniversary\",\"festival\"]','[\"her\",\"1-tier-\",\"valentine-day\"]',NULL,'cmq2aide00001pvoou1f9tqu7','2026-06-07 14:34:14.150','2026-06-07 21:51:56.637','[\"Chocochips\",\"Hazelnut\",\"Nutella\",\"Belgian Chocolate\",\"Almond Truffle\",\"Truffle Dutch\",\"Butterscotch\",\"Salted Caramel\",\"Red Velvet\",\"Pineapple\",\"Blueberry\",\"Strawberry\",\"Kesar Pista\",\"Rose\"]','[]',300,299,'[{\"name\":\"Chocochips\",\"price500g\":550},{\"name\":\"Hazelnut\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Nutella\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Belgian Chocolate\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Almond Truffle\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Truffle Dutch\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Butterscotch\",\"price500g\":550},{\"name\":\"Salted Caramel\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Red Velvet\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Pineapple\",\"price500g\":450},{\"name\":\"Blueberry\",\"price500g\":450},{\"name\":\"Straw